{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46906","headline":"宜春江上寄仰山长老二首 一 · 齐己","name":"宜春江上寄仰山长老二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水隔孤城城隔山，水边时望忆师闲。\n清泉白日中峰上，落日半空栖鸟还。\n云影触衣分朵朵，雨声吹磬散潺潺。\n传心莫学罗浮去，後辈思量待扣关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}